description=Systemless override of SEC_FLOATING_FEATURE_SETTINGS_CONFIG_BRAND_NAME (Galaxy S25 -> Galaxy S26) for SM-S931B. Model number, IMEI, serial, bootloader and firmware are untouched. Remove the module to roll back.
